From 7546a25f9282c33b3773611387e4f8f6a464fcb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:09:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/58] qwen4_exp: FP8 E4M3 KV reader for QSA with a static
 scale sidecar

FP8 E4M3 KV read path for the Qwen4Exp sparse attention (QSA), indexer and
pre-indexer kernels on sm_86, dequantised with a static per-layer scale loaded
from a JSON sidecar, validated against the model's QSA layer set and applied
per pipeline stage. Includes the offline absmax collector that produces the
sidecar and a CUDA-graph-safe clipping counter.
